# Artificial Evolution changes Romulan to Elf; Trait Doctoring changes black to green for turn 3 (CR 612.2a, 612.4).
# The first token keeps those words after the color change expires; the next is a black Elf, both tapped when made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Sela, Tal Shiar Paradox
Mox Sapphire
Trait Doctoring
Artificial Evolution
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
